{"title":"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>While using a skipping rope, Emily jumps 52 times in 60 seconds. Jumping at this same rate, how many times does Emily jump in 75 seconds?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219b229ae2d99fd0de42685875e4d624208bea1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 66 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 52 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 65 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 67 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Emily jumps <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1d1611143f5792dc0f61f3b130af88cb790c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$52$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> times in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> seconds, Emily jumps <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53b94794a55914721b5dcd1446d999ed84d7d392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{52}{4} = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> times in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/55708f60b6ea6f0236ec79e1b539ee80929cb762.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60}{4} = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" /> seconds.\n</p><p>Thus, in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/6/166119f3a28b931d60f9bbdedf7d7a9f4fc6fb15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 \\times 5 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> seconds, Emily jumps <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba1da001859d4140924787d837c129bcc2d70e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 \\times 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 65}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"140\" height=\"30\" /> times.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>